 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The word came down in days of old",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "King Jehoiakim upon the throne",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A test for those who lived as told",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Rechabites in their home",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the house of the Lord I went",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Into a chamber set aside",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the sons of Hanan went",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Igdaliah by their side",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was called the man of God",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A name of honor held in trust",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Beside the officials it was",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Above the keeper of the dust",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bowls of wine were set before",
